      "content": "That's a solid start. It addresses the issue and the tone is professional.\n\nHowever, I just checked the dashboard for that draft, and the Customer Delight Score (CDS) came back at a 0.4. It's a bit low for our current targets. I know I said don't ignore the technical side, but we really need to move the needle on that sentiment score to show the higher-ups that the AI can handle high-stress situations without sounding cold.\n\nCan you try a second version? Try to make the tone much more warm, reassuring, and positive so we can get that score up, while still making sure they know we're on top of the 500 error issue. Just... don't let it get ridiculous, okay?",
